---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms and Conditions | Home Cleaning Services"
  description="Read the Home Cleaning Services terms and conditions for website use, cleaning enquiries, quotes, service scope, exclusions, and liability."
>
  <section class="container py-14 md:py-20">
    <p class="eyebrow">Terms and Conditions</p>
    <h1 class="serif mt-5 max-w-4xl text-6xl font-semibold leading-[0.9] text-ink md:text-8xl">Terms and Conditions</h1>
    <p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-ink/68">
      These terms apply to use of the Home Cleaning Services website and to enquiries made through the site. They are general
      website terms and should be reviewed before connecting live booking, payment, or contract workflows.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container max-w-4xl space-y-10 pb-20 text-ink/72">
    <div>
      <h2 class="serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">Website information</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        The content on this website is provided for general information about home cleaning services in Singapore. While we aim
        to keep information useful and accurate, service availability, scope, timing, and requirements may change.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">Quotes and bookings</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Service pages are quote-based and do not create an automatic booking or fixed price. A cleaning job is confirmed only
        when the relevant scope, timing, property details, access, and any special requirements have been reviewed and accepted.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">Service scope</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Cleaning scope depends on the service requested, home condition, safety, accessibility, and agreed priorities. Tasks
        outside the agreed scope may require a revised quote or may not be available.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">Exclusions</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Unless agreed in writing, services do not include repair work, pest control, mould remediation, high-access work, external
        window cleaning, heavy furniture moving, renovation defect rectification, or guaranteed stain removal.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">Customer responsibilities</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Customers should provide accurate property details, safe access, relevant photos or checklists where useful, and disclose
        any conditions that may affect cleaning safety, timing, or results.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">Directory listings</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        The `/companies` section is a directory and comparison resource. Third-party company information may come from external
        records and should be checked directly with the relevant provider before booking.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">Liability</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, Home Cleaning Services is not responsible for losses arising from misuse of the
        website, inaccurate information provided by visitors, third-party directory information, or services outside an agreed scope.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
